# Two windows that quit in full screen come back to it: macOS fails a window's request to enter
# full screen while another window's transition is running, so the launch restore asks for one
# window at a time. A scenario has only one display; both windows share it, and each still gets a
# full-screen Space of its own.
requires screen
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
seed windows.json {"windows":[{"fullScreen":true},{"fullScreen":true}]}
wait 6
cra://debug?windowState=restored
expect-log window state restored: main0 fullscreen=1
expect-log window state restored: main1 fullscreen=1
